WEBVTT

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.610
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:23.140
In this wide world

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.320
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:34.900
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.530
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:45.640
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.610
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:55.920
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.680
Awaken now

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:12.000
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.240
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:22.010
It's certain

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:26.380
Woh woh

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.690
I appreciate the meal!

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:37.450
Certainly! Eat up.

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:42.500
Wow, this grilled yellowtail is delicious!

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.370
Really? I'm so glad you enjoy it!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:55.140
Well, the food you make is
always delicious, though!

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.180
Thank you.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.920
I'm not trying to flatter you.
It really is delicious!

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:01.720
Yes, I understand.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.920
There they go again...
Yes, I understand.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:03.990
There they go again...
These pickled vegetables are good, too...

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:04.820
These pickled vegetables are good, too...

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.160
Even the miso soup is great!

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:12.260
You totally know what I like or something...

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:16.770
Keiichi! The food I've made
is most certainly better!

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:17.530
Here, open your mouth. Here, it's delicious!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.160
Whoa, hey! Cut it out!
Here, open your mouth. Here, it's delicious!

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:24.210
It's good?!

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:25.970
Naturally!

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:28.910
Here, say "ah."

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:36.220
Well? I'm sure it's even tastier
when I feed it to you, right?

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:37.450
Uh, yeah...

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.620
Is it good?

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.250
Here, say "ah!"

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:47.500
You can have some of this next...

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.130
Peorth, you were reading my issues
of Dobon again, weren't you?!
You can have some of this next...

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.730
Peorth, you were reading my issues
of Dobon again, weren't you?!
I can't eat any more!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.060
Peorth, you were reading my issues
of Dobon again, weren't you?!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.370
What do you want?

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.040
You dirty skank!

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.040
Skuld, this isn't what you think!
You dirty skank!

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:00.180
Skuld, this isn't what you think!

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.180
What do you mean by that?

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.370
Come on now, open wide!

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.410
Cut it out, Peorth!

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:13.120
Here now, say "ah," Keiichi!

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:19.180
Ah! I Just Can't Say It!

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.420
It's your fault for being spineless!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.420
Huh?

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.760
Don't "huh" me!

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.190
Huh...

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:34.140
Keiichi, you don't LIKE having
Peorth all over you, do you?

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.840
For crying out loud, NO!

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.350
Then send her home, quick.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.870
Don't you care how Belldandy feels?!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.290
How... Belldandy feels?

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:50.260
Have you forgotten about
her "jealousy storm"?

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:54.160
If you keep this up,
she might explode again.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.130
Is that what you want?

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.810
So what now? It's your call.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.880
Sorry! One sec...

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:16.850
Go ahead.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.480
Such a piece of work...

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.700
Oh, boy.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.010
Yeah, it's a jealousy storm, all right.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.280
That's it!

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.050
Even if it is a little late...

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:53.180
What we need to do is have
a welcome party for Peorth!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.710
I'll get things ready right away!

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.260
What the...

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:01.390
Was I wrong?

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:11.840
It's good?!

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.640
Naturally!

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.580
Here, say "ah."

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:28.520
DOBON

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:31.030
DOBON
So that's it...

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:35.260
That's what I did wrong the other day!

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.600
All right then, next time
I'll get it right, and...

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.540
Wait a minute! What do you mean
"to be continued next month"?!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.510
Oh, I wanna know what happens!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.910
The bug had gotten inside you,
so I was able to determine its location.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:58.350
That's why this was a team effort
between you and me.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:05.250
Belldandy... You...

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:06.820
Peorth.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.320
Such a grave expression...
What's the matter?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.060
Wish?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.510
Please tell me. What should I ask you?

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.840
That's a strange thing to ask.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:24.710
Isn't a wish something that
you, yourself desire?

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:28.150
Well, it is, but...

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:33.490
For starters, a wish can only be input
as spoken by the recipient...

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:37.360
My own wishes in this matter are immaterial.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.490
I guess you're right.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.560
Nevertheless...

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.800
We won't get anywhere at this rate, will we?

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.300
I suppose I'll give you a hint.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.530
Hint?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:54.600
Take a look in the middle
drawer in your desk.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:04.540
The middle drawer in my desk?

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.180
Th-This is...

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.360
Peorth!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.660
Did you find it?

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:16.160
What kind of "hint" is this supposed to be?!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.570
Ah, yes, that's it all right.

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:21.270
What the heck is this supposed to mean?!

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:25.570
It means be honest with yourself.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.470
Huh?

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.740
Do you mean to tell me...

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:40.450
that you're here to grant my..."desires"?

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:44.290
You didn't realize that until now?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:50.360
W-Well, no matter.
As long as you understand now.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.870
Okay then! Go ahead and
lay that wish on me!

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:54.840
No way.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.340
Why not?!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:02.440
Forget it. I'm not interested in
anything that doesn't involve love...

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.880
So you mean you're not interested if
love isn't part of the equation?

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:07.780
Right...

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:12.380
You're saying you don't have
any love for me, aren't you?

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.650
Isn't it obvious?

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.460
Very well. If you'll go so far as to say that...

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:22.360
Huh?

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:28.000
I'm in love with you, Keiichi.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.240
Did that help?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.380
Wh-What the heck is going on here?

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:44.220
Huh?

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:49.090
Belldandy told me once that
goddesses can't tell lies.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.330
Urd and Skuld might be able to,
since they're Second Class goddesses,

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:56.800
but there should be no way for
a First Class goddess like you to!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.500
Exactly what the HECK is going on here?!

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.730
You seem to have been under
the wrong impression...
Exactly what the HECK is going on here?!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:00.630
You seem to have been under
the wrong impression...

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:03.270
Well then, that's that.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.830
Come on, Keiichi, let's hear that wish!

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:09.840
Go on!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:15.940
Okay.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:21.380
I want you to fulfill my desires...

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.420
That's what you want me to say, right?

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:37.160
Whoa, wait! That's not what I meant to say.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:42.370
That's not it!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.620
Your wish has been accepted.

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:24.980
Your wish has been accepted.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.110
Huh?

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:31.750
Okay, time to grant that wish...

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.700
You won't get away from me.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.970
I hope Keiichi will say
this is delicious, too.

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:08.060
Belldandy...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:12.460
What's wrong? You were so disoriented...

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.990
Big Sister? Have you seen my
issues of Dobon anywhere?

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.330
Keiichi!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.680
Why are you always doing this?!
Don't get the wrong idea, Skuld!

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:23.410
Why are you always doing this?!
We just ran into each other! It was an accident!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.380
We just ran into each other! It was an accident!

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:27.680
Squish?

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.580
Gotcha.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:33.490
You're not getting away.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:34.360
You're the one who took my issues
of Dobon, aren't you?!
You're not getting away.

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:36.690
You're the one who took my issues
of Dobon, aren't you?!

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:39.130
I was at a good part in Miracle Miki!

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.590
He certainly is quick on the run!

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:49.840
There we go.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.410
Kick the dirt...

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.580
Move forward, faster than the wind!

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:58.240
Dash on, as though soaring through the sky!

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:04.680
You'd better not underestimate me!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:08.610
Oh, brother...

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:17.470
I made a mad dash out here...
but where do I run from here?

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:18.470
Keiichi?

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:19.330
Huh?

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:22.040
Did something happen between
you and Peorth?

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:25.740
Why do you have to run away from her?

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:28.440
It's just that my wish got...

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.640
Wish?

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.640
Er...

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.940
Did something happen with a wish?

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.190
No! No way!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.310
Oh! Keiichi! Behind us!

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.620
No way!

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:51.070
Keiichi! I will satisfy your passions!

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.300
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:53.000
Passions?
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.020
Passions?

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:56.370
Keiichi!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.540
I told you that's not what I meant!
Keiichi!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.010
I told you that's not what I meant!

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.840
What's going on?

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.240
Uh, I'll explain to you later.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:06.140
For now, I'll get us away from Peorth.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.220
I gaze intently upon small stars,

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.980
listen carefully and hear their whispers...

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.790
All ye who twinkle unite,
and invite it into your small world.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.480
Be a good boy and accept
this heavenly blessing!
All ye who twinkle unite,
and invite it into your small world.

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:22.550
She won't be able to catch up
to us for a while now.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:28.630
Now she's done it...

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.670
You did it! Nice job, Belldandy!

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:32.970
What the...

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:35.700
Oh, I'm about out of gas.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.880
Crap. I didn't bring my wallet.

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:42.650
I guess we'll just go there for now...

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:58.230
I don't believe Belldandy would go
to such lengths to interfere!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:01.130
That's exactly what I hate about her so much!

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:06.170
Well, now... what shall I do now?

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:08.880
Is this the extent of a
First Class Goddess's powers?

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.280
What are you here for?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:15.650
Those two have probably gone
to the university.

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:16.620
Huh?

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:20.820
Why are you telling me that?

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.290
I guess it's for Belldandy's sake, right?

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:28.960
I don't know when you caught on, but you
see she can be pretty difficult, too.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:33.770
You've known her for some time,
so I'll leave this in your hands.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.670
Well, see ya. Good luck with that!

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:36.640
Urd...

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:46.580
Well, then... Time to go a-hunting.

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:58.390
What do we do now?

00:14:58.390 --> 00:14:59.690
Keiichi...

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.960
What is this wish you were
talking about before?

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:05.300
Um, well it's, uh...

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.860
Be honest with yourself.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:16.040
She's right... If I say that wasn't
my wish, I'd be lying.

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:20.080
It's what Belldandy wants, too.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:24.980
It's not like she's deliberately avoiding it.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:28.910
There's something that's making her
keep her distance from it.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:35.330
Even if there's love...

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.800
Or isn't there any love?

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:41.130
Keiichi?

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:46.470
Belldandy, I...

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.500
If I...

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.380
Is that really my wish?

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:04.220
My...

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.390
Keiichi?

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.030
What is it?

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:12.430
Was Peorth's cooking good?

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.430
What?

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:17.800
Did her cooking taste better than mine?

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.070
Belldandy...

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:25.370
No, not at all! Your cooking was delicious.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:26.770
But...

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:30.680
That was only because Peorth
was forcing me to eat it!

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:32.890
It wasn't like I enjoyed doing it!

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:34.720
It was good, wasn't it?

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:37.560
Y-Yeah...

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:39.060
I see.

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.250
But I'm saying that yours is...

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.720
Belldandy?

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:47.390
Spit it out!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.930
Don't tell me she's jealous!

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.140
Jealous of Peorth?!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:00.080
I thought I told you earlier.

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:02.140
No way...

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:08.490
Keiichi, what should I do?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.550
Belldandy...

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.690
I found you!

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:17.800
Peorth! Why are you running
Keiichi down like this?!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:21.260
Running down? I'd say YOU'RE
the one who's doing that!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:22.430
Huh?

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:28.710
Have you forgotten that Keiichi is a man?

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:34.310
If you are here because you see it
as your duty, then I pity Keiichi.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:34.750
Peorth!
If you are here because you see it
as your duty, then I pity Keiichi.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:35.150
Peorth!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:35.480
Peorth!
Are you aware that you're a
First Class Goddess?

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:38.610
Are you aware that you're a
First Class Goddess?

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:44.790
Stop it, Peorth! I...

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:48.230
Do you know why I have been
summoned to Earth?

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.030
Huh?

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:54.400
Even if it was a mistake to begin with,
I am here to grant a wish.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:57.390
I am here to grant YOUR wish.

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:10.280
Belldandy, you asked if something
happened between me and Keiichi.

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:15.310
He told me that he wants me
to fulfill his desires.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:20.250
It's not true, Belldandy.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:25.030
She made her report to Heaven
before I was done talking!

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.730
So it's a mistake!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.840
Belldandy!

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.240
Wait!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.800
Belldandy?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.380
It's not out of duty.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.250
If it were, it wouldn't hurt so much...

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:53.290
I...

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:57.430
Okay, Keiichi, I will grant your wish.

00:18:57.430 --> 00:18:58.400
Wait!
Okay, Keiichi, I will grant your wish.

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.230
I...

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.110
I will grant what you desire.

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.870
Stop it!
I will grant what you desire.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:09.470
I...

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:11.210
Belldandy.

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:11.980
Huh?!
Belldandy.

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:12.380
Huh?!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:17.970
It's true I might have desired it
somewhere in my heart...

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:23.090
It might be why that phone call
went through to Peorth.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:28.890
But, it's because I love you, Belldandy.

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:35.390
You're the one I want to be with forever.

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:41.440
Because of who you are...

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.710
Belldandy!

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:50.410
I love you, Keiichi!

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:53.580
Belldandy...

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.520
I love you!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.830
Peorth?

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:05.930
This is Peorth.

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:09.700
Yes, I have completed my mission.
I will return now.

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.170
Peorth?!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.330
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:18.510
Too bad for you, Keiichi.

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:22.540
You see, I am famous in Heaven for
providing the very best services.

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:27.880
Peorth!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:38.090
Do you mean... you did what you
did to get me to say that?

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.400
Belldandy.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.370
Yes?

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:45.240
That truly is something I hate about you.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.410
But it's also the reason
I can't truly hate you.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:55.850
Peorth!

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:56.350
Peorth!
Peorth!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:56.940
Peorth!

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:01.390
Thank you for your request.

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:03.790
I doubt we will meet again.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.670
Peorth!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:23.470
Peorth, did you do this because
of what happened before?

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:27.510
Or is it because you really do love Keiichi?

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:00.710
They're gone!

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:02.650
They're gone! My issues of Dobon are gone!

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:05.410
Ran Ran and Bessatsu Tomodachi
and all of them!

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:07.680
DOBON

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:11.860
Oh, no! What am I going to do
about the next volume?

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:20.760
I did so want to service him...

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:33.740
Woh, it starts to shine

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:50.530
The gentle wind I felt on my cheek

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:59.290
Was the start of the miracles you brought

00:22:59.970 --> 00:23:07.440
As though my everyday life until
then had never existed

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:13.050
My new happy life, completely repainted

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:16.450
In the colors of spring

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:21.400
Even waking up early, even traffic jams

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:25.800
Even heavy things to carry,
even sleepless nights

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:30.140
Somehow I feel thankful for everything

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:34.840
Let's create more and more of our miracles

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:42.680
Woh, whatever kind of morning

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:51.190
Woh, it starts to shine

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:54.660
Every day is a miracle

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:58.370
Everyone has turned back at
least once in their lives.

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.270
But the single-minded passion of one

00:24:00.270 --> 00:24:03.070
brings new inspiration to a heart
that was about to give up.

00:24:03.240 --> 00:24:04.540
Next time, "Ah! Grasp Your Dream
With Your Own Hands!"

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:06.270
Ah! Grasp Your Dream
With Your Own Hands!
Next time, "Ah! Grasp Your Dream
With Your Own Hands!"

00:24:06.270 --> 00:24:09.510
Ah! Grasp Your Dream
With Your Own Hands!
So who is this club founder that
the Seniors are so scared of?
